caption: Armor of Father Sky

Armor of Father Sky: You can strip (other than a few straps for weapons or potions) and paint yourself in blue woad to make you as tough as an armored opponent.  DR (Only While Nude -20%, Tough Skin -40%, Magical -10%, ½ DR without 10 min prep), Capped at 2x Power Investiture. Can have up to 1 level of Hardened and/or Absorbative.
